{"id": "ST_Trinkets|AshenVerdict", "source_en": "Grants the Ashen Verdict boon.\n\nBy this instrument, the fires of the wicked shall be turned against them. None may stand against the power of the divine. ", "category": "item", "speaker": null, "ar": "تمنح ميزة \"الحكم الرمادي\". \n\nبهذه الأداة، ستتحول نيران الأشرار ضدهم. لا يمكن لأحد الوقوف ضد القوة الإلهية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 8}}
